  {
    "RowId": 13038,
    "Text": "Explorer Mode"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 13039,
    "Text": "Revisit a dungeon in its completed state.\n\nExplorer Mode allows access to the following:\n・Explorer Mode-exclusive actions\n・Minions, mounts, and fashion accessories\n・Changing jobs (excluding DoL/DoH classes)\n・Performance actions\n\n<span style=\"color: #ff8080;\">※Available only for selected duties completed by the player.\n※Only the party leader's settings are applicable.\n※Enabling Explorer Mode will disable all other Duty Finder participation requirement settings.</span>"
  },
